{"id":1151101,"name":"依唯·审查Ⅰ","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"依唯·审查Ⅰ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1151101]}],"trial":{"trial_id":151101,"stage":"阶段1","unlock_time":"2026-10-08 14:00:00","diary1":"法露儿事件后，MBCC持续关注相关人员的狂厄反应。近日，禁闭者依唯的M值多次异常波动，并伴随明显的身体透支迹象。\n　　根据程序，你启动了针对她的审查，想在引发狂厄暴走前遏制住这一负面变化。","diary2":"通过审查，你得知依唯近期受妙丽喵经纪人邀请，以粉丝身份参与宣传，并在演出中违规使用异能。她明知身体不适，却始终把这些损耗视作可以忍耐的小事，看不到其中的危险。\n　　而这并非偶然。依唯的原生家庭教给她的逻辑里，不顾惜自己身体的付出是获得爱的必要条件，你的几句话无法改变她的行事逻辑。要想彻底排除她过度付出引发异能暴动的可能，也许你有必要陪她去见一见那个始终在她世界中心的人——妙丽喵。","evidence":[{"ID":260979,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260980,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":16,"dialogue_id":251101001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":7,"dialogue_id":251101002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":3,"dialogue_id":251101005,"next":[6]},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":3,"dialogue_id":251101010,"next":[11]},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":251101022,"next":null},{"step":23,"course":2,"dialogue_id"